widow|bereaved-spouse|NOUN|Woman whose spouse has died|A woman whose spouse has died and who has not remarried.|góa phụ|The novel follows a widow rebuilding her life.|Tiểu thuyết kể về một góa phụ xây dựng lại cuộc sống.|Countable; widow versus widower.|0
wonderful|excellent|ADJECTIVE|Very good or enjoyable|Very good, enjoyable, or pleasing.|tuyệt vời|We had a wonderful afternoon at the lake.|Chúng tôi có một buổi chiều tuyệt vời bên hồ.|Evaluative adjective.|0
weary|tired|ADJECTIVE|Very tired|Very tired, especially after effort or a long time.|mệt mỏi; mệt lả|The weary travellers stopped to rest.|Những lữ khách mệt mỏi dừng lại nghỉ.|Weary person; weary of is further construction.|-
wheel|part|NOUN|Rotating circular part|A round part that turns around an axle, especially on a vehicle.|bánh xe|One wheel of the cart came loose.|Một bánh xe của xe đẩy bị lỏng.|Countable.|0
wood|material|NOUN|Tree material|The hard material forming the trunk and branches of a tree.|gỗ|The shelves are made of recycled wood.|Kệ được làm bằng gỗ tái chế.|Uncountable material.|0
wood|trees|NOUN|Small wooded area|An area of land covered with trees, often smaller than a forest.|khu rừng nhỏ|A path leads through the wood behind the farm.|Một lối đi xuyên khu rừng nhỏ sau trang trại.|Countable wood; woods common.|1
